OL,3,GNEWSAMore homes approved for
OL,4,Aredevelopment site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for more homes on a development
OL,7,Fhave been given the go-ahead despite
OL,8,Fconcerns it would push it into the
OL,9,Fcountryside.
OL,11,FDurham County Council has granted
OL,12,Fpermission in principle for up to six
OL,13,Fhomes on land next to the former St
OL,14,FPeter's School site, in Gainford.
OL,16,FIt is part of the wider redevelopment
OL,17,Fof the site, with permission previously
OL,18,Fgranted for a total of 48 homes.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
